# Secrets. `.env` holds ATCODER_REVEL_SESSION (a login cookie) and
# YUKICODER_API_KEY -- never commit it to ANY repository. Copy .env.example
# to .env and fill it in locally instead.
#
# This lives here, next to the file it protects, rather than in the repo-root
# .gitignore, so that it travels with .devcontainer/ into every repository this
# directory is published to (see also the public mirror tb158/ahc-lib-rs).
/.env
